### Standard shipping quote (result in paise)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/shipping/quote?distance_km=10&weight_grams=1500

### Priority shipping quote
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/shipping/quote?distance_km=10&weight_grams=1500&priority=true

### Validation: negative distance
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/shipping/quote?distance_km=-4&weight_grams=1500
